{"id":"n69464-1-16","stage":0,"title":"목소리 · 嗓音","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69464-1-16-1","ko":"목소리가 왜 그래?","zh":"你的声音怎么啦？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목소리가","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목소리가","audio":"/audio/74012d13a64ca3e5b621.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a8e52be6db7fcd6095fa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69464-1-16-2","ko":"소리를 많이 질렀더니 목이 아파서 그래.","zh":"因为刚才喊得太厉害，所以嗓子疼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소리를","meaning":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","explanation":"소리：嗓音，嗓子，嗓门；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"3","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리를","audio":"/audio/ae6206e81ef916ec8723.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"질렀더니","meaning":"喊叫","explanation":"지르다：喊叫；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"지르다","audio":"/audio/987e83fdad67159dfb76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62312","senseId":"1","lemma":"지르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질렀더니","audio":"/audio/7df8a9f71ded7ae3702a.mp3"}},{"text":"목이","meaning":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","explanation":"목：喉咙，嗓子，咽喉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"2","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목이","audio":"/audio/12ba5841dcaa9b5a4d16.mp3"}},{"text":"아파서","meaning":"疼，痛","explanation":"아프다：疼，痛；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"2","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파서","audio":"/audio/1d188c109f3d5cabce14.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"从人的喉咙发出的声音。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/